                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Many games say they are \"rogue likes,\" but this one really is.  And, it has a sort of neat crafting system.. The music is repetitive, but not really annoying, and the sound and music levels can be adjusted separately. Works windowed or full screen. Visuals are nothing to write home about, but , when you wield a sword, you can see it, so that's nice...especially since when it's not there anymore, you realize it broke and that you need to make a new one. Recommended for those who have played and enjoyed the likes of Nethack, Moria, ADOM, etc. I like it a lot.",
